que</span> devant le verbe.</li><li>Vous inversez le verbe et le pronom.</li></ol>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Est-ce que Mika est ton fr\u00e8re ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Est-ce que tu nages ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "As-tu une minute ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Es-tu fatigu\u00e9 ?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "La forme n\u00e9gative", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Pour utiliser la forme n\u00e9gative <span class = \"strong italic\">ne... pas</span>, vous placez le verbe apr\u00e8s le  <span class=\"italic\">ne</span>. Quand le verbe commence avec une voyelle ou la lettre <span class=\"italic\">h</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ne</span> devient <span class=\"italic\">n'</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"4\",\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Ne... pas</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">N'... pas</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Je ne marche pas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Je n'habite pas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Il ne mange pas<br/>Elle ne mange pas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Il n'aime pas <br/>Elle n'aime pas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nous ne nageons pas\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nous n'aimons pas\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "pr\u00e8s de ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "\u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(pr\u00e9position)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La piscine est pr\u00e8s de la gym.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le01ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Le verbe <span class=\"italic\">faire</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Vous utilisez le verbe <span class=\"italic\">faire</span> pour d\u00e9crire des activit\u00e9s sportives.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"je fais\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tu fais\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"il/elle/on fait\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nous faisons\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"vous faites\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ils/elles font\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Je fais du sport.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Je fais du yoga.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Cherchez 3 personnes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Demandez comment elles vont.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Posez des questions pour obtenir des informations personnelles. Posez des questions comme : <span class=\"italic\">O\u00f9 habitez-vous ? Faites-vous du sport ? Qu'est-ce que vous faites comme sport ?</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez leurs r\u00e9ponses.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "J'\u00e9cris le nom des gens.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je pose des questions pour obtenir des informations personnelles.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9change des informations personnelles.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "frn2le01ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "frn2le01ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  As-tu une minute pour un caf\u00e9 ? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> :  Excellente id\u00e9e !"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "3750", "id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  Comment vas-tu Jean ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> :  \u00c7a va bien, merci. Et toi ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  Comme ci comme \u00e7a, je suis un peu fatigu\u00e9e."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "12500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Est ce que tu connais Chez Nanette ?  Ils ont un excellent caf\u00e9.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  J'adore le caf\u00e9. Je bois un caf\u00e9 tous les matins. Es-tu  \u00e9galement fatigu\u00e9 ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "22000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> :  Non, je ne suis pas fatigu\u00e9.  Peut \u00eatre qu'on devrait faire plus de sport ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  Tu as raison, mais je n'ai pas le temps.  Est-ce que tu fais du sport ?"}, {"image": "frn2le01ob03re2img02.jpg", "time": "32000", "id": 5, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Oui, je nage tous les jours avec Mika.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  Est-ce que Mika est ton fr\u00e8re ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Non, ce n'est pas mon fr\u00e8re, c'est un ami. La piscine est pr\u00e8s de chez moi."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "44500", "id": 6, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  O\u00f9 habites-tu ?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : J'habite dans le quartier latin."}, {"image": "frn2le01ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "48500", "id": 7, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Charlotte</span> :  Ah, c'est un bel endroit. Est-ce que c'est loin ? <br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Jean</span> : Non, ce n'est pas tr\u00e8s loin."}], "audiosrc": "frn2le01ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le01ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Quelles sont les diff\u00e9rentes fa\u00e7ons de dire \u201cComment \u00e7a va&nbsp;?\u201d", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Je peux demander aux gens comment ils vont.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux construire des phrases pour exprimer comment vont les gens.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux partager des informations personnelles.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  Quoi de neuf ? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez  \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Comment allez-vous ? \u00c7a va bien !", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Jean demande \u00e0 Charlotte : <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">comment \u00e7a va&nbsp;?</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "Vous avez deux essais.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "ll vous reste un essai", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Essayez encore une fois !", "type": "text"}, {"content": "La prochaine fois peut-\u00eatre.", "ty